    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Paraopticon </h2>is a Spot the Difference / Puzzle Game, where you are a security guard that is task to <br>compare camera feeds and spot and report different events to survive the night shift.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay:</h2>The rules are simple:<br>You have 15-30 ingame-minutes to memorize the rooms.<br>At 12:00 AM Anomalies will appear; You have to report them;<br>Too many anomalies unreported will have you killed.<br>You have to make it to 6:00 AM.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Keep your eyes peeled</h2>Be aware: hundreds of anomalies per level and thousands of possibilities.<br><br>Be scared: special events an entities to observe and save yourself from.<br><br>Be prepared: use different items to help you find the anomalies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>HD Graphics.<br></li><li>Many different Items.<br></li><li>Alot and i mean aaaaalot of Anomalies.</li></ul>",
